# Sample LSP Completion Request

File: lsp/examples/completion_request.oot

## Request

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "textDocument/completion",
  "params": {
    "textDocument": {
      "uri": "file:///home/user/project/main.oo",
      "text": "let x: Fs"
    },
    "position": { "line": 0, "character": 9 }
  }
}
```

## Expected response (shape)

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "result": {
    "isIncomplete": false,
    "items": [
      { "label": "FsReadCap", "kind": 25 }
    ]
  }
}
```

Items come from the canonical seed plus any compiler-merged user symbols.
`HttpCap` and `UnsafeFFICap` are not in the seed.
